 # 15\. Error Handling Demonstration

 The system is also demonstrated under failure conditions.

 ### Example: Gemini API Unavailable

```
Student Question
       ↓
Gemini Request
       ↓
Service Unavailable
       ↓
EduGenie Error Handler
       ↓
"Unable to process your request.
Please try again later."
```

 The application should display a user-friendly message without exposing API keys, stack traces, or internal server information.

