 # 16\. Logout Demonstration

 After completing the learning session, the student selects **Logout**.

```
Student
   ↓
Logout
   ↓
Session Terminated
   ↓
Login/Home Page
```

 The system prevents access to protected student pages after logout unless the user authenticates again.

