 # 20\. Project Demonstration Conclusion

 The demonstration of **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** presents the complete workflow of the proposed AI-powered learning platform. It shows how a student can register, interact with the Gemini-powered AI Tutor, summarize learning materials, generate and complete quizzes, receive feedback, and monitor learning activity.

